nstructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Listen to the audio.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Click on TRUE if the statement is true.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Click on FALSE if the statement is false. </span>\n", "type": "text"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob05re6aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "CHW", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 10, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 11, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn11le03ob05re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nListen to a meeting and take minutes (notes) of the meeting.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn11le03ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Thank you very much, everybody, for attending today's board meeting.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Mr. Douglas</span>: My pleasure, as always, Ms. Moore. I just hope the meeting doesn't last three hours like last time.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: We'll try to keep things brief in order to expedite the meeting today, Mr. Douglas. The board meeting is called to order at 7:00 p.m. Could we approve the minutes from the last meeting? Are there any amendments?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Mr. Santos</span>: Just a small note, my last name is spelled with an S not a Z.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Thank you, Mr. Santos. Any other amendments to the minutes? No? All in favor of approving the meetings from March 25 of last year? Carried. Now for the Chief Executive's Report. Mr. Gardiner, you have the floor.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn11le03ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gardiner</span>: We have so many plans for significant growth that I feel the most pressing matter is the rental space. I recommend that we sign the lease for the spaces on the 10th and 11th floors in order to remain in the same building.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Mr. Douglas</span>:  I examined the budgetary provisions for that rental space. It's very expensive. Our operations budget shortfall is very large so I don't think we can afford it at the present time. Denise, what do you think?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>:  The quarterly report shows that we are in a somewhat tight situation. We can count on our regular sales to booksellers, but the school market share is still fragile. Our workbooks are so new that we don't have a significant number of sales in financial literacy publications yet.", "id": 2, "time": "41000", "image": "engenn11le03ob05re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Santos</span>: Then, there is the problem of our unsettled lawsuits over plagiarism last year.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Yes, we will be dealing with that for quite some time.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Mr. Douglas</span>: Did you deal with the employees who were involved, Denise?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Yes, we have terminated the employment of one editorial assistant, and replaced him with two very bright young graduates.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gardiner</span>:  We could wait another six months so as to solidify our volume of sales before moving office space. Our long-term staffing goals are so ambitious that the move should happen before the end of the fiscal year.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>:  Agreed.", "id": 3, "time": "86000", "image": "engenn11le03ob05re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le03ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le03ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}